            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "At the end of each survey cycle, we send a thank-you letter to the president/chancellor of each institution that completes the survey. In that letter, we acknowledge the person listed as the primary contact. If there are other individuals who should also be thanked in the letter, please let us know in the box below. Please limit to 2 individuals, and provide first and last names and job titles."
